                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وِصْلٌ</span></b> 
                         and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُصْلٌ</span></b> 
                        <i>A limb:</i> see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَخِذٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعْمٌ</span>;
and see also Har, p. 346. Between every
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَصْلَانِ</span> [or rather between every <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَصْل</span> and the
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَصْل</span> next to it] is a <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وِصْل</span>. (O, K, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فصل</span>.)

